[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1863.99, "timestamp": "00:31:03", "text": "而且还能获得报酬。我仔细想过了。其实，我觉得我内心深处总有那么一面，对吧？它总是告诉我，是啊，我的技术不行。我需要提升自己的技术，让它变得非常精湛。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1868.87, "timestamp": "00:31:08", "text": "所以，你知道，我可以做点什么，比如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1875.75, "timestamp": "00:31:15", "text": "做一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1878.389, "timestamp": "00:31:18", "text": "商业项目之类的，然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1881.11, "timestamp": "00:31:21", "text": "获得报酬，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1884.47, "timestamp": "00:31:24", "text": "我的意思是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1888.47, "timestamp": "00:31:28", "text": "如果我的技术很差，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1891.909, "timestamp": "00:31:31", "text": "那我为什么还能拿到报酬呢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1893.269, "timestamp": "00:31:33", "text": "？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1895.669, "timestamp": "00:31:35", "text": "或者说，为什么有人会因为做得不好而获得报酬呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1902.95, "timestamp": "00:31:42", "text": "就是这样。 我觉得这是我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1905.83, "timestamp": "00:31:45", "text": "理想之一。我想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1913.509, "timestamp": "00:31:53", "text": "也许这就是我为什么会有这种"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1915.509, "timestamp": "00:31:55", "text": "想法的原因吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1919.19, "timestamp": "00:31:59", "text": "我也不知道。但"}]